#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choosing a data access approach"
msgstr "Escolhendo uma forma de acesso aos dados"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Yii3 keeps database access in optional packages. A new application doesn't get a global `Yii::$app->db` component\n"
"or a built-in Active Record layer automatically, so choose the package and boundary that fit your application.\n"
msgstr ""
"O Yii3 deixa o acesso ao banco de dados em pacotes opcionais. Uma aplicação nova não ganha automaticamente um componente global `Yii::$app->db`\n"
"nem uma camada de Active Record embutida, então escolha o pacote e a fronteira que fazem sentido para a sua aplicação.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you used Yii 2.0 database access layer, `yiisoft/db` is the closest Yii3 equivalent. It provides database\n"
"connections, commands, schema support, and a query builder. Instead of calling `Yii::$app->db`, configure a\n"
"connection as a service and inject `ConnectionInterface` where the database is needed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Se você usava a camada de acesso ao banco de dados do Yii 2.0, o `yiisoft/db` é o equivalente mais próximo no Yii3. Ele oferece\n"
"conexões, comandos, suporte a esquema e um query builder. Em vez de chamar `Yii::$app->db`, configure uma\n"
"conexão como serviço e injete `ConnectionInterface` onde o banco de dados for necessário.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "If you used Yii 2.0 Active Record, you can install `yiisoft/active-record`. It is useful when your model classes mostly describe tables and relations. For applications where Yii 2.0 Active Record classes also contain form validation, request scenarios, authorization checks, or business workflows, move those responsibilities to form models, services, and domain objects instead of putting them back into the record class."
msgstr "Se você usava o Active Record do Yii 2.0, pode instalar o `yiisoft/active-record`. Ele é útil quando suas classes de model descrevem principalmente tabelas e relações. Em aplicações em que as classes Active Record do Yii 2.0 também contêm validação de formulário, cenários de requisição, verificações de autorização ou fluxos de negócio, mova essas responsabilidades para form models, serviços e objetos de domínio em vez de colocá-las de volta na classe do registro."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "For most application code, put a repository or query service between the action/service layer and storage:"
msgstr "Na maior parte do código da aplicação, coloque um repositório ou serviço de consulta entre a camada de actions/serviços e o armazenamento:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "actions and application services depend on repository methods such as `findOneBySlug()`, `findAll()`, `save()`, and `deleteBySlug()`;"
msgstr "actions e serviços da aplicação dependem de métodos do repositório como `findOneBySlug()`, `findAll()`, `save()` e `deleteBySlug()`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "the repository hides whether persistence is implemented with `yiisoft/db`, Active Record, Cycle, Doctrine, or another storage;"
msgstr "o repositório esconde se a persistência é feita com `yiisoft/db`, Active Record, Cycle, Doctrine ou outro armazenamento;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "the repository is the place to map raw database rows or records to typed objects used by the rest of the code."
msgstr "o repositório é o lugar para converter as linhas brutas do banco de dados ou os registros em objetos tipados usados pelo resto do código."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Small CRUD applications can start with a concrete repository class. Larger applications usually benefit from a repository interface in the domain or module and an implementation in the infrastructure layer."
msgstr "Aplicações CRUD pequenas podem começar com uma classe de repositório concreta. Aplicações maiores costumam se beneficiar de uma interface de repositório no domínio ou módulo e de uma implementação na camada de infraestrutura."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "In this guide, we will focus on working with relational databases using Yii DB. We'll use PostgreSQL to implement a simple CRUD (create read update delete)."
msgstr "Neste guia, vamos focar no trabalho com bancos de dados relacionais usando o Yii DB. Vamos usar PostgreSQL para implementar um CRUD simples (create, read, update, delete: criar, ler, atualizar e excluir)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing PostgreSQL"
msgstr "Instalando o PostgreSQL"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "You need to install PostgreSQL. If you prefer not to use Docker, [get the installer from official website](https://www.postgresql.org/download/), install it and create a database."
msgstr "Você precisa instalar o PostgreSQL. Se preferir não usar Docker, [baixe o instalador no site oficial](https://www.postgresql.org/download/), instale e crie um banco de dados."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "If you use Docker, it is a bit simpler. Modify `docker/dev/compose.yml`:"
msgstr "Se você usa Docker, é um pouco mais simples. Altere `docker/dev/compose.yml`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"services:\n"
"    app:\n"
"        build:\n"
"            dockerfile: docker/Dockerfile\n"
"            context: ..\n"
"            target: dev\n"
"            args:\n"
"                USER_ID: ${UID}\n"
"                GROUP_ID: ${GID}\n"
"        env_file:\n"
"            -   path: ./dev/.env\n"
"            -   path: ./dev/override.env\n"
"                required: false\n"
"        ports:\n"
"            - \"${DEV_PORT:-80}:80\"\n"
"        volumes:\n"
"            - ../:/app\n"
"            - ../runtime:/app/runtime\n"
"            - caddy_data:/data\n"
"            - caddy_config:/config\n"
"        tty: true\n"
"        depends_on:\n"
"            db:\n"
"                condition: service_healthy\n"
"\n"
"    db:\n"
"        image: postgres:${POSTGRES_VERSION:-18}-alpine\n"
"        environment:\n"
"            POSTGRES_DB: app\n"
"            POSTGRES_PASSWORD: password\n"
"            POSTGRES_USER: user\n"
"            POSTGRES_INITDB_ARGS: \"--locale-provider=icu --icu-locale=und --encoding=UTF8\"\n"
"        volumes:\n"
"            - ../runtime/db:/var/lib/postgresql:rw\n"
"        ports:\n"
"            - \"${DEV_DB_PORT:-5432}:5432\"\n"
"        healthcheck:\n"
"            test: [ \"CMD-SHELL\", \"pg_isready -U user -d app\" ]\n"
"            interval: 5s\n"
"            timeout: 5s\n"
"            retries: 5\n"
msgstr ""
"services:\n"
"    app:\n"
"        build:\n"
"            dockerfile: docker/Dockerfile\n"
"            context: ..\n"
"            target: dev\n"
"            args:\n"
"                USER_ID: ${UID}\n"
"                GROUP_ID: ${GID}\n"
"        env_file:\n"
"            -   path: ./dev/.env\n"
"            -   path: ./dev/override.env\n"
"                required: false\n"
"        ports:\n"
"            - \"${DEV_PORT:-80}:80\"\n"
"        volumes:\n"
"            - ../:/app\n"
"            - ../runtime:/app/runtime\n"
"            - caddy_data:/data\n"
"            - caddy_config:/config\n"
"        tty: true\n"
"        depends_on:\n"
"            db:\n"
"                condition: service_healthy\n"
"\n"
"    db:\n"
"        image: postgres:${POSTGRES_VERSION:-18}-alpine\n"
"        environment:\n"
"            POSTGRES_DB: app\n"
"            POSTGRES_PASSWORD: password\n"
"            POSTGRES_USER: user\n"
"            POSTGRES_INITDB_ARGS: \"--locale-provider=icu --icu-locale=und --encoding=UTF8\"\n"
"        volumes:\n"
"            - ../runtime/db:/var/lib/postgresql:rw\n"
"        ports:\n"
"            - \"${DEV_DB_PORT:-5432}:5432\"\n"
"        healthcheck:\n"
"            test: [ \"CMD-SHELL\", \"pg_isready -U user -d app\" ]\n"
"            interval: 5s\n"
"            timeout: 5s\n"
"            retries: 5\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Note that we add `depends_on` so application waits for database to be up."
msgstr "Repare que adicionamos `depends_on` para que a aplicação espere o banco de dados subir."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> [!IMPORTANT]\n"
"> Also, we'll need a `pdo_pgsql` extension to communicate with PostgreSQL. You can enable it locally in `php.ini`.\n"
msgstr ""
"> [!IMPORTANT]\n"
"> Também vamos precisar da extensão `pdo_pgsql` para falar com o PostgreSQL. Você pode habilitá-la localmente no `php.ini`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "If you use Docker, check `docker/Dockerfile` and add `pdo_pgsql` in `install-php-extensions` list:"
msgstr "Se você usa Docker, abra `docker/Dockerfile` e adicione `pdo_pgsql` à lista do `install-php-extensions`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (dockerfile)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"RUN install-php-extensions \\\n"
"    opcache \\\n"
"    mbstring \\\n"
"    intl \\\n"
"    dom \\\n"
"    ctype \\\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"    phar \\\n"
"    openssl \\\n"
"    xml \\\n"
"    xmlwriter \\\n"
"    simplexml \\\n"
"    pdo \\\n"
"    pdo_pgsql\n"
msgstr ""
"RUN install-php-extensions \\\n"
"    opcache \\\n"
"    mbstring \\\n"
"    intl \\\n"
"    dom \\\n"
"    ctype \\\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"    phar \\\n"
"    openssl \\\n"
"    xml \\\n"
"    xmlwriter \\\n"
"    simplexml \\\n"
"    pdo \\\n"
"    pdo_pgsql\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Then rebuild PHP image with"
msgstr "Depois, reconstrua a imagem do PHP com"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "make build && make down && make up\n"
msgstr "make build && make down && make up\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring connection"
msgstr "Configurando a conexão"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Now that we have the database, it's time to define the connection."
msgstr "Agora que temos o banco de dados, é hora de definir a conexão."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "First we need a package to be installed:"
msgstr "Primeiro, precisamos instalar um pacote:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "make composer require yiisoft/db-pgsql:2.*\n"
msgstr "make composer require yiisoft/db-pgsql:2.*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Now create `config/common/di/db-pgsql.php`:"
msgstr "Agora crie `config/common/di/db-pgsql.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Connection\\ConnectionInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Connection;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Driver;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    ConnectionInterface::class => [\n"
"        'class' => Connection::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'driver' => new Driver(\n"
"                $params['yiisoft/db-pgsql']['dsn'],\n"
"                $params['yiisoft/db-pgsql']['username'],\n"
"                $params['yiisoft/db-pgsql']['password'],\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Connection\\ConnectionInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Connection;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Driver;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    ConnectionInterface::class => [\n"
"        'class' => Connection::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'driver' => new Driver(\n"
"                $params['yiisoft/db-pgsql']['dsn'],\n"
"                $params['yiisoft/db-pgsql']['username'],\n"
"                $params['yiisoft/db-pgsql']['password'],\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "And define parameters in `config/common/params.php`. For Docker that would be:"
msgstr "E defina os parâmetros em `config/common/params.php`. Para o Docker, fica assim:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Dsn;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    // ...\n"
"    'yiisoft/db-pgsql' => [\n"
"        'dsn' => new Dsn('pgsql', 'db', 'app', '5432'),\n"
"        'username' => 'user',\n"
"        'password' => 'password',\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Dsn;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    // ...\n"
"    'yiisoft/db-pgsql' => [\n"
"        'dsn' => new Dsn('pgsql', 'db', 'app', '5432'),\n"
"        'username' => 'user',\n"
"        'password' => 'password',\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "`db` host is resolved automatically within the Docker network."
msgstr "O host `db` é resolvido automaticamente dentro da rede do Docker."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "For local installation without Docker the host in Dsn would be `localhost`. You'll have to adjust the rest to match how you configured the database."
msgstr "Em uma instalação local sem Docker, o host no Dsn seria `localhost`. Ajuste o resto conforme a forma como você configurou o banco de dados."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Multiple database connections"
msgstr "Várias conexões de banco de dados"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "When the application works with several databases, keep `ConnectionInterface` for the primary connection and add a class alias for each named connection:"
msgstr "Quando a aplicação trabalha com vários bancos de dados, mantenha `ConnectionInterface` para a conexão principal e adicione um alias de classe para cada conexão nomeada:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Db\\AnalyticsDatabase;\n"
"use App\\Db\\MainDatabase;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Connection\\ConnectionInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Connection;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Driver;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"class_alias(Connection::class, MainDatabase::class);\n"
"class_alias(Connection::class, AnalyticsDatabase::class);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    ConnectionInterface::class => MainDatabase::class,\n"
"\n"
"    MainDatabase::class => [\n"
"        'class' => Connection::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'driver' => new Driver(\n"
"                $params['app/db']['main']['dsn'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['main']['username'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['main']['password'],\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"\n"
"    AnalyticsDatabase::class => [\n"
"        'class' => Connection::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'driver' => new Driver(\n"
"                $params['app/db']['analytics']['dsn'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['analytics']['username'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['analytics']['password'],\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Db\\AnalyticsDatabase;\n"
"use App\\Db\\MainDatabase;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Connection\\ConnectionInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Connection;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Driver;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"class_alias(Connection::class, MainDatabase::class);\n"
"class_alias(Connection::class, AnalyticsDatabase::class);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    ConnectionInterface::class => MainDatabase::class,\n"
"\n"
"    MainDatabase::class => [\n"
"        'class' => Connection::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'driver' => new Driver(\n"
"                $params['app/db']['main']['dsn'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['main']['username'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['main']['password'],\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"\n"
"    AnalyticsDatabase::class => [\n"
"        'class' => Connection::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'driver' => new Driver(\n"
"                $params['app/db']['analytics']['dsn'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['analytics']['username'],\n"
"                $params['app/db']['analytics']['password'],\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "The alias class names are used as service IDs and type hints. They don't need PHP files of their own."
msgstr "Os nomes das classes alias são usados como IDs de serviço e type hints. Eles não precisam de arquivos PHP próprios."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Define matching parameters:"
msgstr "Defina os parâmetros correspondentes:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Dsn;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    // ...\n"
"    'app/db' => [\n"
"        'main' => [\n"
"            'dsn' => new Dsn('pgsql', 'db', 'app', '5432'),\n"
"            'username' => 'user',\n"
"            'password' => 'password',\n"
"        ],\n"
"        'analytics' => [\n"
"            'dsn' => new Dsn('pgsql', 'analytics-db', 'analytics', '5432'),\n"
"            'username' => 'analytics_user',\n"
"            'password' => 'analytics_password',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Pgsql\\Dsn;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    // ...\n"
"    'app/db' => [\n"
"        'main' => [\n"
"            'dsn' => new Dsn('pgsql', 'db', 'app', '5432'),\n"
"            'username' => 'user',\n"
"            'password' => 'password',\n"
"        ],\n"
"        'analytics' => [\n"
"            'dsn' => new Dsn('pgsql', 'analytics-db', 'analytics', '5432'),\n"
"            'username' => 'analytics_user',\n"
"            'password' => 'analytics_password',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/start/databases.md
msgid "Services that need the primary database can still depend on `ConnectionInterface`. Services that need another database should type-hint the corresponding alias:"
msgstr "Serviços que precisam do banco de dados principal continuam podendo depender de `ConnectionInterface`. Serviços que precisam de outro banco de dados devem usar o alias correspondente como type hint:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
